      "quote": "the seam can only decide from params, nothing in the params separates a prompt cli will obey from one it will not, and a wrong-kind answer becomes a model failure upstream"
    },
    {
      "id": "kp5",
      "hit": true,
      "quote": "reword the oracle `why` strings, docblock and plan table with the measured figures (0/4 vs 3/3), add a test pinning the wording"
    },
    {
      "id": "kp6",
      "hit": true,
      "quote": "record the ~164K-token prefix cost as a separate policy matter (`--bare` is not an escape hatch)."
    }
